---
// Debbie Reber quote — from Tilt Parenting, leading 2e voice
---

<section class="w-full bg-white py-[clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem)]" aria-labelledby="debbie-reber-quote">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--ysa-max)] px-[clamp(1rem,4.44vw,4rem)]">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[56rem]">
			<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#1E1B4B_0%,#1A3560_100%)] shadow-[0_16px_48px_-12px_rgba(30,27,75,0.3)]">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-0 lg:flex-row">
					<!-- Left accent -->
					<div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-8 py-8 text-center lg:w-52 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:py-12">
						<div class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#7C3AED,#5751E4)] text-2xl font-black text-white shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(124,58,237,0.4)]" aria-hidden="true">
							DR
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-bold text-white">Debbie Reber</p>
							<p class="m-0 mt-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#A78BFA]">Tilt Parenting Podcast</p>
							<p class="m-0 mt-1 text-[0.6875rem] text-white/40">Bestselling Author & 2e Advocate</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Right: Quote -->
					<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center px-8 py-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-12">
						<div class="mb-3 text-[4rem] font-serif leading-none text-[#7C3AED]/20 select-none" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</div>
						<blockquote class="m-0 p-0">
							<p class="m-0 text-[clamp(1.0625rem,1.9vw,1.25rem)] font-semibold italic leading-[1.7] text-white">
								YSA is my favorite virtual program for neurodivergent kids.
							</p>
							<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8] text-white/60">
								It's built differently — from the ground up for kids whose brains work differently. The small class sizes, the mentors who were once these kids, the low-demand environment... it's everything parents of 2e children have been asking for.
							</p>
						</blockquote>
						<footer class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
							<p class="m-0 text-xs text-white/40">Host of Tilt Parenting Podcast · Author of <em>Differently Wired</em></p>
						</footer>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
